id: pm-github-ygye
title: Configure the release app for automatic workflow stamping
description: "Operational dependency of pm-github-znig. Install a dedicated GitHub App on this repository with Contents, Workflows, Pull requests and Actions write plus Checks read. Set RELEASE_APP_CLIENT_ID repository variable and RELEASE_APP_PRIVATE_KEY repository secret. The release workflow mints and revokes installation tokens automatically; GITHUB_TOKEN lacks workflow-write authorization. Verify the next scheduled release can push, merge, publish with OIDC and tag the stamped workflow commit. No release dispatch is authorized by this task."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-16T12:52:32.568Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-16T13:04:53.893Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: App installed with documented permissions and repository configuration; a normal scheduled release records a successful stamped-workflow metadata transaction.
